  "note": "Tokens of the freedom tree window «ВОЛЯ.narod» (mockup body[data-f=freedom]: its variables and the literal colours of its rules). Every name starts with 'freedom_' so the seven skin files never collide; only the freedom skin task edits this file (source/ui/SKINS.md). Fonts: the mockup's Verdana is PT Sans, Times is PT Serif, Comic Sans is Pangolin, Impact is Oswald 600, the LED counters are the vanilla 7segment. exact text size = the cell height = round(CSS px x the face's cell ratio x k), where k matches the x-height of the mockup's own face: PT Sans draws 0.91 of Verdana's x-height at one em (k = 1.1), PT Serif 1.11 of Times' (k = 0.9; the bold marquee keeps k = 1, as wide as bold Times); Pangolin and Oswald are within 2-11 % of Comic Sans and Impact (k = 1). Measured 2026-10-31 with the TTFs of both faces (the freedom skin task report). Bold, italic and glow exist only on the SDF faces (SetBold / SetItalic / text shadow are no-ops on bitmap faces, measured 2026-10-31), so the mockup's bold Comic (node names, status, button, 'Сторінка в розробці!'), bold Times (marquee), italic Times (dev line), bold Courier (LED counters: PT Mono) and the glowing Impact (branch name) use ozl_sdf_*; their label boxes are k x S tall (fonts README). Half-transparent fills are corrected for the game's linear-light blending: black at a is 1 - (1 - a)^2.2 (box .72 -> .939, tree .82 -> .977, footer .75 -> .953).",
